@MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5267

### 1. OpenAPI v1 Document
GET {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### 2. Get Active Categories Dropdown List
GET {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/article-category/list
Accept: application/json

### 3. List My Articles (Tbl_RequestArticle: Draft, Submitted, Approved, Rejected)
POST {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/article/List
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Page": 1,
  "PageSize": 20,
  "SearchKeyword": null,
  "ArticleCategoryId": null,
  "Status": null
}

### 4. Get My Article Detail (By RequestArticleId)
POST {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/article/Detail
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "RequestArticleId": "01JREQ00000000000000000002"
}

### 5. Submit My Draft Article for Admin Review
POST {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/article/SubmitForReview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "RequestArticleId": "01JREQ00000000000000000002"
}

### 6. Delete My Article (Allowed While Status != Approved)
POST {{MagizineAuthor.Api_HostAddress}}/api/author/article/Delete
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "RequestArticleId": "01JREQ00000000000000000002"
}
